[2026-02-02T19:45:04.177+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:45:04 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.agrigentonotizie.it/eventi/concerti-jazz-classica-palacongressi-gennaio-aprile-2026.html>
{'category': ['Concerti'],
